  m_text: '<align="center">Mage

    ----------------------------</align>

    The
    Mage learns spells to autocast them when advancing through the stages.<br><br>Spells
    can be equipped through slots.<br>Spell can be ranked up to increase their effectivness.<br>Every
    5 levels of Scholar ability a new spell is unlocked, and every 5 levels of Proficiency
    ability a new slot to equip spells will be unlocked.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
