      m_Calls: []
  m_text: <align="center">Necromancer<br>----------------------------</align><br>Max
    out your Necromancer abilities to unlock new permanent rituals.<br>The Necromancer
    trains by making is summons fight themselves, increasing the Aptitude ability
    will also increase the amount of summons that will fight.<br>All Necromancer
    abilities will increase the summon statistics, except for aptitude and luck,
    that will also increase the amount of experience gained by the Necromancer.
