  m_text: '<align="center">Warrior

    ----------------------------</align>

    Defeat
    the enemies to advance through the stages. Warrior stats can be increased by
    doing other jobs too.<br><br>Enemies may drop collectable cards.<br>Exceeding
    cards can be dismantled into Bits, or convert 6 of them into a random one.'
