  m_text: '<align="center">Miner

    ----------------------------</align>

    Break
    rocks to collect ores and upgrade your weapon''s level to increase the damage
    dealt to enemies.<br>Rocks have a chance to drop at most one rarity higher than
    theirs, and not all rocks will drop ores.'
